{"ID":"20240118151229-m8c41qg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151229-m8c41qg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151229-m8c41qg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151229-b55kklm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621103308-flcvd24\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621103308-flcvd24\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"123蜜蜡","type":"doc","updated":"20240621103308"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151229-b55kklm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151229-b55kklm","updated":"20240122113045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘微温，主下利脓血，补中益气续绝伤，治金创，益气不饥耐老，今用之甚稀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113049-jiuw9ip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113049-jiuw9ip"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味淡甘，性温。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113050-h5k1c88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113050-h5k1c88"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】止血，安胎，补益要药，治孕妇胎动下血有殊效，又为硬膏基础剂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113052-luyzady","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113052-luyzady"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】蜜蜡主孕妇胎动，下血不绝欲死，以鸡子大煎三五沸，投美酒半升服立瘥。又主白发镊去，消腊点孔中，即生黑者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113053-upa9f2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113053-upa9f2g"}},{"ID":"20240122113054-ygz9ene","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113054-ygz9ene"}},{"ID":"20240122113054-jqhjdpv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113054-jqhjdpv","updated":"20240130143459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第123味药，蜜蜡，这个蜜蜡呢？这里这个地方指的是，蜂蜡，我查证的结果是蜂蜡，并不是我们内经讲的松树掉的，松子掉在地下的那个蜂蜡。跟它有点差异，实际上是蜂蜡。所以它后面甄权就讲的蜜蜡呢孕妇胎动，跟那个什么，蜂蜡是相同的治证，本草经，在上经的时候，实际上原来上经是一百二十味，可是呢？后人的，原文已经散失了，后人增简增简就一百四十几味。老师怎么一百四十味？很多是重复的，还有很多掉了这个到底什么名字查不到，很多重复了，所以多了很多。所以我们现在教一百二十三，还在上经，还没完，实际上上经只有一百二十味药。"}]},{"ID":"20240621103308-flcvd24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621103308-flcvd24"}}]}